### Page 4 of 4

```text
Appointments of Miles Henderson and Jason Bogstie to the Public Transit Advisory Board;
Suzanne Meisner-Esquibel to the Housing and Community Development Advisory Council; Lori
Schoene to the Cheyenne Housing Authority Board; and Phillip Regeski to the Planning
Commission.  Mr. White moved to approve, seconded by Mr. Roybal.  Mr. Esquibel declared a
conflict of interest as his wife is a proposed appointee to the Housing and Community
Development Advisory Council and vacated Council Chambers during discussion and vote.
Motion carried.  Voting “yes” – all members of the governing body present with the exception of
Mayor Orr who did not vote (mayoral appointment), Mr. Esquibel declaring a conflict of interest
and Dr. Rinne voting “no”.

There being no further business to come before the governing body, the meeting was
officially adjourned at 6:23 p.m.

Submitted by,

Kristina F. Jones, City Clerk

This notice is available in alternative, accessible formats upon request.

Published:
Wyoming Tribune-Eagle

October 24, 2019
